      "moduleId": "rn_q7VWTgBZpxbjJvm5::L2",
      "stem": "Contrast discontinuous and continuous variation by cause.",
      "misconceptionClass": "recall of the taught account",
      "kind": "recall",
      "modelAnswer": "Discontinuous variation is usually genetic and monogenic, while continuous variation combines polygenic genes with environmental factors.",
